Following up on the huge success of [[QHLAN2022]], the way is paved for '''QHLAN2024''' to return to [https://goo.gl/maps/LzV8vF9jakfb3wi89 Epic Studios], the huge dance studio owned by old school [[Clan 9]] legend {{player|Sniket|flag=se}}. 

This time one day longer, starting on wednesday 10th Jan - QHLAN2024 aim to give players more time to settle in and warmup for the tournaments set for thursday, friday and saturday, one day per tournament.
QHLAN2024 was livestreamed by [http://twitch.tv/TastySpleenTV TastyspleenTV].

